{
  "name": "[Stock] Phone Booking - 2. Vapi Tools",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Stage 2: Vapi Tools (mid-call)\nWhile the AI is talking to the caller, Vapi calls these tools synchronously and speaks the result back.\n\nIn the Vapi Assistant config, add two Custom Tools, both pointing at:\nhttps://keystoneconsultancy.app.n8n.cloud/webhook/vapi/tools\n\n1) check_availability { date, preferredTime, service }\n2) book_appointment { date, time, service, customerName, customerPhone, customerEmail }\n\nThe calendar step below uses Google Calendar as the stock/placeholder backend. Swap the two Google Calendar nodes for a Google Sheets (or other) lookup per client without touching anything else - the rest of the contract (tool call in, {results:[...]} out) stays identical.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "tools-note",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -1120,
        -280
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "vapi/tools",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "webhook-vapi-tools",
      "name": "Vapi Tool Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -1120,
        160
      ],
      "webhookId": "vapi-tool-call"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "tool-call-id",
              "name": "toolCallId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.toolCallList[0].id }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "tool-name",
              "name": "toolName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.toolCallList[0].name }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "tool-args",
              "name": "toolArgs",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.message.toolCallList[0].arguments }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-extract-tool-call",
      "name": "Extract Tool Call",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -880,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_CONFIG_WORKFLOW_ID",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "exec-client-config",
      "name": "Get Client Config",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflow",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -640,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "merge-tool-call-id",
              "name": "toolCallId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Tool Call').item.json.toolCallId }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "merge-tool-name",
              "name": "toolName",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Tool Call').item.json.toolName }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "merge-tool-args",
              "name": "toolArgs",
              "type": "object",
              "value": "={{ $('Extract Tool Call').item.json.toolArgs }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-merge-context",
      "name": "Merge Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -400,
        160
      ],
      "notes": "Combines Client Config output (calendar id, business hours, slot length) with the extracted tool call, since Execute Workflow replaces the item's json."
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rules": {
          "values": [
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.toolName }}",
                    "rightValue": "check_availability",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "check_availability"
            },
            {
              "conditions": {
                "options": {
                  "caseSensitive": true,
                  "leftValue": "",
                  "typeValidation": "strict"
                },
                "conditions": [
                  {
                    "leftValue": "={{ $json.toolName }}",
                    "rightValue": "book_appointment",
                    "operator": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "operation": "equals"
                    }
                  }
                ],
                "combinator": "and"
              },
              "renameOutput": true,
              "outputKey": "book_appointment"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "fallbackOutput": "extra"
        }
      },
      "id": "switch-tool-name",
      "name": "Route On Tool Name",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.switch",
      "typeVersion": 3.2,
      "position": [
        -160,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "event",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $json.googleCalendarId }}",
          "mode": "expression"
        },
        "timeMin": "={{ $json.toolArgs.date }}T00:00:00",
        "timeMax": "={{ $json.toolArgs.date }}T23:59:59",
        "options": {
          "timeZone": "={{ $json.timezone }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "gcal-get-busy",
      "name": "Google Calendar - Get Day's Events",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        80,
        40
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_CALENDAR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Calendar - REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "const config = $('Merge Context').item.json;\nconst busyEvents = items.map(i => i.json);\nconst args = config.toolArgs;\n\nconst slotMinutes = config.bookingSlotDurationMinutes || 30;\nconst [startH, startM] = (config.businessHoursStart || '09:00').split(':').map(Number);\nconst [endH, endM] = (config.businessHoursEnd || '17:00').split(':').map(Number);\n\nconst dayStart = new Date(`${args.date}T00:00:00`);\ndayStart.setHours(startH, startM, 0, 0);\nconst dayEnd = new Date(`${args.date}T00:00:00`);\ndayEnd.setHours(endH, endM, 0, 0);\n\nconst busyRanges = busyEvents.map(e => ({\n  start: new Date(e.start?.dateTime || e.start?.date),\n  end: new Date(e.end?.dateTime || e.end?.date),\n}));\n\nconst slots = [];\nfor (let t = new Date(dayStart); t < dayEnd; t = new Date(t.getTime() + slotMinutes * 60000)) {\n  const slotEnd = new Date(t.getTime() + slotMinutes * 60000);\n  const overlaps = busyRanges.some(b => t < b.end && slotEnd > b.start);\n  if (!overlaps) {\n    slots.push(t.toTimeString().slice(0, 5));\n  }\n}\n\nconst preferredTime = args.preferredTime;\nconst preferredAvailable = preferredTime ? slots.includes(preferredTime) : false;\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    date: args.date,\n    preferredTime: preferredTime || null,\n    preferredAvailable,\n    alternativeSlots: slots.filter(s => s !== preferredTime).slice(0, 5),\n    allAvailableSlots: slots,\n  }\n}];"
      },
      "id": "code-compute-slots",
      "name": "Compute Available Slots",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        320,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "avail-result-text",
              "name": "resultText",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.preferredTime && $json.preferredAvailable ? ($json.date + ' at ' + $json.preferredTime + ' is available.') : ($json.preferredTime ? ($json.date + ' at ' + $json.preferredTime + ' is not available. Alternative times on ' + $json.date + ': ' + $json.alternativeSlots.join(', ') + '.') : ('Available times on ' + $json.date + ': ' + $json.allAvailableSlots.join(', ') + '.')) }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-avail-result",
      "name": "Build Availability Result Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        560,
        40
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "event",
        "operation": "create",
        "calendar": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "={{ $('Merge Context').item.json.googleCalendarId }}",
          "mode": "expression"
        },
        "start": "={{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.date }}T{{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.time }}:00",
        "end": "={{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.date }}T{{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.time }}:00",
        "additionalFields": {
          "summary": "={{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.service }} - {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.customerName }}",
          "description": "=Booked via AI phone assistant.\nService: {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.service }}\nCustomer: {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.customerName }}\nPhone: {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.customerPhone }}\nEmail: {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.customerEmail }}"
        }
      },
      "id": "gcal-create-event",
      "name": "Google Calendar - Book Slot",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleCalendar",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        80,
        300
      ],
      "notes": "The 'end' field here is a placeholder equal to start; set end = start + serviceDurationMinutes via an upstream Code/Set node once you know each service's duration from Client Config's serviceMenu.",
      "credentials": {
        "googleCalendarOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_GOOGLE_CALENDAR_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Google Calendar - REPLACE_WITH_CLIENT_NAME"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "booking-result-text",
              "name": "resultText",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=You're booked for {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.service }} on {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.date }} at {{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolArgs.time }}. A confirmation email is on its way."
            },
            {
              "id": "booking-event-id",
              "name": "calendarEventId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.id }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-booking-result",
      "name": "Build Booking Result Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        320,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "error-result-text",
              "name": "resultText",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Sorry, I couldn't process that request."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-error-result",
      "name": "Build Unknown-Tool Result Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        80,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "final-tool-call-id",
              "name": "toolCallId",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $('Merge Context').item.json.toolCallId }}"
            },
            {
              "id": "final-result",
              "name": "result",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "={{ $json.resultText }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "set-final-response",
      "name": "Build Tool Response",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        780,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { results: [ { toolCallId: $json.toolCallId, result: $json.result } ] } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "respond-tool-result",
      "name": "Return Tool Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        1020,
        160
      ]
    }
  ],
